<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Top Comet Overseas Employment Agency | Yangon, Myanmar</title>
<meta name="description" content="Top Comet Overseas Employment Agency in Yangon supports job seekers and overseas employers with recruitment coordination, interview preparation, documentation assistance, and work-permit support.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="Top Comet Overseas Employment Agency | Yangon, Myanmar">
<meta property="og:description" content="Recruitment coordination, interview preparation, documentation assistance, and work-permit support for job seekers and overseas employers.">
<meta property="og:locale" content="en_US">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap">
<style>
:root{--blue:#b01c22;--blue-d:#b01c22;--sky:#f3f4f6;--sky2:#e2e4e8;--navy:#2b2e33;--ink:#2b2e33;--mute:#565b63;--bg:#fff;--card:#fff;--line:#dcdfe3;--sh:0 10px 30px rgba(43,46,51,.12);box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){color-scheme:dark;--blue:#ff7a7f;--blue-d:#c8282f;--sky:#2a2c30;--sky2:#3a3d42;--navy:#141517;--ink:#eceef0;--mute:#b4b9c0;--bg:#1c1d20;--card:#26282c;--line:#3f4247;--sh:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{color-scheme:dark;--blue:#ff7a7f;--blue-d:#c8282f;--sky:#2a2c30;--sky2:#3a3d42;--navy:#141517;--ink:#eceef0;--mute:#b4b9c0;--bg:#1c1d20;--card:#26282c;--line:#3f4247;--sh:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:100px}
body{margin:0;font-family:"Plus Jakarta Sans",Inter,"Noto Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.65;font-size:17px}
img,svg{max-width:100%}a{color:inherit}
.wrap{width:min(1120px,100% - 40px);margin-inline:auto}
section{padding:80px 0}
h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 .5em}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5.5vw,3.7rem);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.4vw,2.3rem);font-weight:800}
h3{font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:700}
p{margin:0 0 1em}
.eyebrow{display:inline-block;background:var(--sky2);color:var(--blue-d);font-weight:700;font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:14px}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .eyebrow{color:var(--blue)}}
.lead{color:var(--mute);font-size:1.1rem}
.center{text-align:center}.center .lead{margin-inline:auto;max-width:64ch}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:14px;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid transparent;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s,background .2s;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:var(--sh)}
a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:3px}
.btn-b{background:var(--blue-d);color:#fff}.btn-b:hover{background:var(--navy)}
.btn-o{background:var(--card);border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue-d)}.btn-o:hover{background:var(--sky)}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .btn-o{color:var(--blue)}}
.ico{width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex:none}
/* floating nav */
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;padding:calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)) 0 0;pointer-events:none}
.pill{pointer-events:auto;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--card) 92%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--sh);border-radius:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 10px 8px 12px;position:relative}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;font-size:.9rem}
.logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;padding:2px;border:1px solid var(--line);flex:none}
nav ul{display:flex;gap:2px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;align-items:center}
nav a{text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:.92rem;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:12px;transition:background .2s}
nav a:hover{background:var(--sky)}
nav a.btn{color:#fff;padding:11px 20px;margin-left:6px}nav a.btn:hover{background:var(--navy)}
.burger{display:none;background:var(--sky);border:0;border-radius:12px;width:46px;height:46px;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}
@media(max-width:980px){
 .burger{display:grid;place-items:center}
 nav{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:calc(100% + 8px);background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;box-shadow:var(--sh);padding:10px;display:none}
 nav.open{display:block}nav ul{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}nav a{display:block}
 nav a.btn{text-align:center;margin:6px 0 0}
}
/* hero */
.hero{margin-top:-84px;padding:170px 0 90px;background:radial-gradient(700px 360px at 12% 18%,var(--sky2),transparent 70%),radial-gradient(600px 340px at 92% 80%,var(--sky2),transparent 70%),linear-gradient(var(--sky),var(--bg))}
.hero .cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin:28px 0 44px}
.chips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;max-width:860px;margin-inline:auto}
.chip{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--sh);text-align:left;font-size:.95rem}
.chip svg{color:var(--blue);width:28px;height:28px}
@media(max-width:700px){.chips{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding-top:150px}}
/* about */
.about .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:44px;align-items:center}
.quote{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#2b2e33,#4a4e55);color:#fff;border-radius:28px;padding:44px 38px;box-shadow:inset 7px 0 0 #d2232a;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.45;position:relative}
.quote::before{content:"";position:absolute;right:-18px;top:-18px;width:90px;height:90px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sky2);z-index:-1}
@media(max-width:860px){.about .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
/* tabs */
.svc{background:var(--sky)}
.tabs{display:inline-flex;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:5px;margin:28px 0 28px;box-shadow:var(--sh)}
.tabs button{border:0;background:none;font:inherit;font-weight:700;padding:11px 24px;border-radius:12px;color:var(--mute);cursor:pointer}
.tabs button[aria-selected="true"]{background:var(--blue-d);color:#fff}
.list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px;text-align:left}
.row{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:18px 20px;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.row:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--sh)}
.row .ic{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sky2);color:var(--blue-d);display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .row .ic{color:var(--blue)}}
.row p{margin:0;color:var(--mute);font-size:.93rem}
.hint{margin:24px 0 0;text-align:center;color:var(--mute);font-size:.95rem}
.panel[hidden]{display:none}
@media(max-width:760px){.list{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
/* timeline */
.tl{list-style:none;margin:44px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:14px;counter-reset:s;position:relative}
.tl::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:24px;left:10%;right:10%;height:3px;background:var(--sky2)}
.tl li{counter-increment:s;text-align:center;position:relative;font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;padding:0 6px}
.tl li::before{content:counter(s);display:grid;place-items:center;width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue-d);color:#fff;font-weight:800;margin:0 auto 14px;border:5px solid var(--bg);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--sky2)}
@media(max-width:860px){.tl{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:32px}.tl::before{left:24px;right:auto;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;height:auto}.tl li{text-align:left;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:0}.tl li::before{margin:0;flex:none}}
.note{margin-top:34px;background:var(--sky);border-radius:16px;padding:16px 20px;color:var(--mute);font-size:.95rem;text-align:center}
/* employers */
.emp{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#2b2e33,#4a4e55);color:#fff;border-radius:30px;padding:56px 48px;display:flex;gap:32px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap}
.emp>div{flex:1 1 420px}.emp p{color:#dbeaf7;margin:0}
.emp .eyebrow{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:#fff}
.emp .btn{background:#d2232a;color:#fff}.emp .btn:hover{background:#b01c22}
/* info */
.info{border:2px dashed var(--blue);background:var(--sky);border-radius:22px;padding:32px;display:flex;gap:18px}
.info .ico{color:var(--blue-d);flex:none;margin-top:4px}
.info p:last-child{margin:0;color:var(--mute)}
/* contact */
.cbox{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;box-shadow:var(--sh);padding:40px}
.cgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:28px;margin:28px 0}
.cgrid h3{color:var(--blue-d);text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:6px}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .cgrid h3{color:var(--blue)}}
.cgrid p{margin:0}.cgrid a{display:block;text-decoration:none;padding:1px 0}.cgrid a:hover{text-decoration:underline;color:var(--blue-d)}
.acts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}
.soc{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);align-items:center}
.soc strong{margin-right:6px}
@media(max-width:760px){.cgrid,.acts{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cbox{padding:26px 20px}}
/* footer */
footer{background:var(--sky);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:48px 0 26px;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--mute)}
.fg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr;gap:28px}
footer .brand{color:var(--ink)}footer h3{color:var(--ink);font-size:.85rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
footer a{text-decoration:none}footer a:hover{text-decoration:underline;color:var(--blue-d)}
.fb{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:28px;padding-top:18px;font-size:.85rem}
@media(max-width:760px){.fg{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true">
<defs>
<symbol id="i-user" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-doc" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h8l5 5v13H6z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-med" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s-8-5-8-11a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8-2.8A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 20 10c0 6-8 11-8 11z"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-chat" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-lang" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 5h10M8 3v2M5 5c1 4 4 7 8 8M11 5c-1 4-4 7-8 8M14 21l4-10 4 10M15.5 18h5"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-pass" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="3" width="14" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/><path d="M9 17h6"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-people" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M2 20c0-3.5 3-6 7-6s7 2.500 7 6M16 4.500a3.500 3.500 0 0 1 0 7M18 14c2.500.5 4 2.500 4 6"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-plane" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 14l20-8-6 16-4-6z"/><path d="m12 16 10-10"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-cal" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-pen" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20l1-5L16 4l4 4L9 19z"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-bed" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 18V6M3 14h18v4M21 14v-2a3 3 0 0 0-3-3h-7v5"/><circle cx="7" cy="11" r="1.500"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-phone" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 4h4l2 5-2.500 1.500a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-mail" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-pin" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s7-6 7-12a7 7 0 0 0-14 0c0 6 7 12 7 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.500"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-info" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 11v6M12 7.500v.01"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-tt" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 3v11.500a3.500 3.500 0 1 1-3.500-3.500M14 3c.3 2.500 2 4.500 5 4.500"/></symbol>
<symbol id="i-fb" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v3H7v4h3v6h4v-6h3l1-4h-4V8.500c0-.3.200-.5.500-.5z"/></symbol>
</defs>
</svg>

<header>
<div class="wrap">
<div class="pill">
 <a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="Top Comet Overseas Employment Agency – Home">
  <img class="logo" src="data:image/png;base64," width="56" height="56" alt="Top Comet Overseas Employment Agency logo">
  <span>Top Comet Overseas<br>Employment Agency</span>
 </a>
 <button class="burger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="menu"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"/></svg></button>
 <nav id="menu" aria-label="Main navigation">
  <ul>
   <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
   <li><a href="#about">About Us</a></li>
   <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
   <li><a href="#job-seekers">For Job Seekers</a></li>
   <li><a href="#employers">For Employers</a></li>
   <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
   <li><a class="btn btn-b" href="#contact">Contact Us</a></li>
  </ul>
 </nav>
</div>
</div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero center" id="home">
 <div class="wrap">
  <span class="eyebrow">Yangon, Myanmar</span>
  <h1>Connecting Myanmar Talent with Overseas Opportunities</h1>
  <p class="lead">Top Comet Overseas Employment Agency supports job seekers and employers through organized recruitment, interview preparation, documentation assistance, and employment coordination.</p>
  <div class="cta">
   <a class="btn btn-b" href="#about">Find Out More</a>
   <a class="btn btn-o" href="#contact">Contact Our Office</a>
  </div>
  <div class="chips">
   <div class="chip"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-people"/></svg>Organized recruitment</div>
   <div class="chip"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg>Documentation assistance</div>
   <div class="chip"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg>Interview preparation</div>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
 <div class="wrap">
  <p class="quote">Our goal is to make the recruitment process clear, organized, and convenient for both candidates and employers.</p>
  <div>
   <span class="eyebrow">Who we are</span>
   <h2>About Top Comet</h2>
   <p class="lead">Top Comet Overseas Employment Agency is an employment agency based in Ahlone Township, Yangon. We support candidates throughout Myanmar and help coordinate recruitment processes between job seekers and overseas employers.</p>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="svc center" id="services">
 <div class="wrap">
  <span class="eyebrow">What we do</span>
  <h2>Our Services</h2>
  <p class="lead">Choose a group to see how we can help.</p>
  <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Service groups">
   <button role="tab" id="t1" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="p1">For Job Seekers</button>
   <button role="tab" id="t2" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="p2">For Employers</button>
  </div>
  <div class="panel" id="p1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t1">
   <div class="list">
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-user"/></svg></div><div><h3>Candidate Registration</h3><p>Registration and recruitment support for candidates.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-med"/></svg></div><div><h3>Medical &amp; Psychological Tests</h3><p>Coordination of medical examinations and psychological tests.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></div><div><h3>Police Record &amp; Documents</h3><p>Help with police-record and document checking.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></div><div><h3>Skills Testing</h3><p>Skills testing arrangements where the position requires it.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-pen"/></svg></div><div><h3>Tax &amp; Labour Department</h3><p>Assistance with tax-clearance and labour-department procedures.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-pass"/></svg></div><div><h3>Passport Application</h3><p>Support with passport application steps.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg></div><div><h3>Interview Preparation</h3><p>Preparation activities before employer interviews.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-lang"/></svg></div><div><h3>Japanese-Language Training</h3><p>Support for Japanese-language training.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></div><div><h3>Work-Permit Documents</h3><p>Assistance preparing work-permit application documents.</p></div></div>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel" id="p2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t2">
   <div class="list">
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-people"/></svg></div><div><h3>Candidate Selection</h3><p>Selection of candidates from the agency database.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-user"/></svg></div><div><h3>Additional Recruitment</h3><p>Further recruitment when more candidates are required.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></div><div><h3>Candidate Documents</h3><p>Preparation of candidate documents for employer review.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-cal"/></svg></div><div><h3>Interview Arrangements</h3><p>Interview arrangements in Myanmar.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></div><div><h3>Preselection &amp; Interviews</h3><p>Coordination of preselection and interview sessions.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg></div><div><h3>Shortlist Preparation</h3><p>Interview preparation for shortlisted candidates.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-pen"/></svg></div><div><h3>Employment Contracts</h3><p>Support with employment contract arrangements.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-pass"/></svg></div><div><h3>Work-Permit Documentation</h3><p>Support with work-permit documentation.</p></div></div>
    <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-plane"/></svg></div><div><h3>Airport &amp; Accommodation</h3><p>Coordination of airport transportation and accommodation.</p></div></div>
   </div>
  </div>
  <p class="hint">Exact requirements depend on the employer, destination country, and job position.</p>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="center" id="job-seekers">
 <div class="wrap">
  <span class="eyebrow">For Job Seekers</span>
  <h2>How the Process Works</h2>
  <p class="lead">Five simple steps from first contact to employment arrangements.</p>
  <ol class="tl">
   <li>Contact the agency</li>
   <li>Register and submit documents</li>
   <li>Complete the required checks or tests</li>
   <li>Attend interview and preparation activities</li>
   <li>Proceed with employment and work-permit arrangements</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="note">Requirements, fees, processing times, and employment conditions may vary depending on the employer, destination country, and position. Please contact the agency for current details.</p>
 </div>
</section>

<section id="employers" style="padding-top:0">
 <div class="wrap">
  <div class="emp">
   <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">For Employers</span>
    <h2>Recruitment Support for Employers</h2>
    <p>We help employers coordinate candidate selection, document review, interviews, employment contracts, and work-permit documentation. Our team can also assist with interview arrangements, travel coordination, accommodation, and related logistics in Myanmar.</p>
   </div>
   <a class="btn" href="#contact">Talk to Our Team</a>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0">
 <div class="wrap">
  <div class="info" role="note">
   <svg class="ico" width="28" height="28"><use href="#i-info"/></svg>
   <div>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.35rem">Important Information</h2>
